      "text": "WHEREAS, the Triborough Bridge and Tunnel Authority and\nsuch Libraries, by the resolutions hereto annexed, have elected to\ncontinue such increased-take-home-pay plan during the 1968-1969 fiscal\nyear of the State; and",
